	<redcap:ProjectNotes>A worked example for the BP+ Data Capture external module.

Install and enable the module on this project, then open the BP+ measurement instrument on any record and press Connect BP+.

The BP+ measurement instrument repeats, so a participant can be measured more than once. To keep the device result file as well, turn on &quot;Store the raw measurement XML as a file&quot; in the module settings -- the bpplus_xml field is already here for it.

This project is a starting point and is meant to be edited.</redcap:ProjectNotes>
